    "summary": "Errata for the Venom. Aerialists now reads: when the Fight phase ends, if this TRANSPORT has no models embarked within it, you may pick a single friendly DRUKHARI INFANTRY unit with 6 or fewer models and wholly within 6\" of the Venom; units that can FLY are not eligible. If the picked unit is not within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, it may embark within the Venom, even if it left a TRANSPORT by disembarking earlier that turn.\nThe Transport section now reads: the Venom can carry 6 DRUKHARI INFANTRY models, and JUMP PACK models cannot be carried. As the Declare Battle Formations step begins, before the battle, you may pick one of your KABALITE WARRIORS, HAND OF THE ARCHON or WYCHES units that has not yet been split, and divide it into two units with their models shared as evenly as possible, noting which models make up each. One of the two must begin the battle aboard this Venom; the other can begin aboard another TRANSPORT or be deployed as its own unit.",
